00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:10,950
When multiple threads execute concurrently across CPU cores, shared mutable state becomes extremely dangerous.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:15,000
Without proper synchronization primitives, you will experience race conditions and silent data corruption.

